      "matn_ar": "قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وآله: ان موسى بن عمران رفع يديه وقال يا رب، ان أخي هارون قد مات فاغفر له، فأوحى الله تعالى إليه: يا موسى، لو سألتني في الاولين والآخرين لاجبتك ما خلا قاتل الحسين فاني لا أغفر له وأنتقم من قاتله. الباب الخامس في فضل المؤمن وحسن الخلق وفضل من اسمه محمد أو أحمد. وباسناده قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وآله: مثل المؤمن عند الله كمثل ملك مقرب وان المؤمن عند الله افضل من ملك مقرب وليس شئ أحب إلى الله من مؤمن تائب أو مؤمنة تائبة. وباسناده قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وآله ان المؤمن يعرف في السماء كما يعرف الرجل في اهله وولده وانه أكرم عند الله من ملك مقرب. وباسناده قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وآله أتاني جبريل عن ربه وهو يقول: ربي عزوجل يقرئك السلام ويقول يا محمد بشر المؤمنين الذين يعملون الصالحات ويؤمنون بك ويحبون اهل بيتك بالجنة فان لهم عندي جزاء الحسنى وسيدخلون الجنة. وباسناده قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وآله من عامل الناس ولم يظلمهم وحدثهم فلم يكذبهم ووعدهم فلم يخلفهم فهو مؤمن كملت مروءته وظهرت عدالته ووجبت محبته وحرمت غيبته.",
      "chain_type": "Alid (Rida)",
      "school": "Medina",
      "text_en": "And by its chain, he said: Abu al-Qasim al-Tayyahi may Allah have mercy on him said: 'Ali ibn Musa al-Radi may Allah be pleased with him said: My father narrated from me; my father Musa ibn Ja'far said: My grandfather narrated from me; my grandfather Ja'far ibn Muhammad said: My father narrated from me; my father Muhammad ibn Ali said: My father narrated from me; my father Ali ibn Al-Husayn said: My father narrated from me; my father Al-Husayn ibn Ali said: My father narrated from me; my father Ali ibn Abi Talib, may Allah be pleased with them all. He said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him, said: 'Musa ibn Imran raised his hands and said, \"O Lord, indeed my brother Harun has died, so forgive him.\" So Allah revealed to him: \"O Musa, if you ask Me concerning the first people and the last people, I will answer you, except for the killer of Al-Husayn; for I do not forgive him and I take vengeance from his killer.\" Chapter Five on the virtue of the believer, good character, and the virtue of one named Muhammad or Ahmad. And by its chain, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him, said: \"The believer is with Allah like a close angel, but the believer with Allah is better than a close angel. There is nothing more beloved to Allah than a repentant believer or a repentant believing woman.\" And by its chain, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him, said: \"The believer is known in the sky as a man knows his family and offspring, and indeed he is more honored with Allah than a close angel.\" And by its chain, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him, said: 'Gabriel came to me from his Lord, and he was saying: \"My Lord, may He be Mighty, sends you greetings and says, 'O Muhammad, give good tidings to the believers who do righteous deeds, believe in you, and love your household; for they have with Me the reward of bliss, and they will enter Paradise.'\" And by its chain, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him, said: \"Whoever treats people and does not wrong them, informs them and does not lie to them, and promises them and does not fail them, he is a believer whose chivalry is complete, whose justice has appeared, whose love is obligatory, and whose absence is forbidden.",
      "translation_confidence": 4,
      "translation_model": "google/gemma-4-e4b"
    },
