        }
      ],
      "matn_ar": "قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وآله عليكم باللحم فانه ينبت اللحم ومن ترك اللحم اربعين يوما ساء خلقه. وباسناده قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وآله عليكم بالعدس فانه مبارك مقدس يرق القلب ويكثر الدمعة وانه قد بارك فيه سبعون نبيا آخرهم عيسى بن مريم عليهما السلام. وباسناده قال علي عليه السلام ذكر الشحم واللحم عند النبي صلى الله عليه وآله قال: ليس منهما بضعه تقع في المعدة الا نبتت مكانها شفاء وخرجت من مكانها داء. *",
      "chain_type": "Alid (Rida)",
      "school": "Medina/Kufa",
      "text_en": "And by his chain, he said: 'Ali ibn Abi Talib, peace be upon him, was given the Prophet, peace and grace be upon him, food, so he inserted his finger, and behold, it was hot. So he said, peace be upon him, \"Leave it until it cools, for indeed it is a great blessing, for Allah Almighty did not feed us what was hot.\" And by his chain, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and grace be upon him, said, \"Be mindful of meat, for indeed meat causes growth. And whoever abandons meat for forty days, his character will be bad.\" And by his chain, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and grace be upon him, said, \"Be mindful of lentils, for indeed they are blessed and sacred, they move the heart and increase tears. And indeed seventy prophets were blessed with it, the last of whom was Jesus son of Mary, peace be upon them both.\" And by his chain, he said: Ali, peace be upon him, mentioned fat and meat to the Prophet, peace and grace be upon him. He said: \"There is nothing from them whose portion falls into the stomach except that it grows in its place a healing, and exits from its place an illness.",
      "translation_confidence": 4,
      "translation_model": "google/gemma-4-e4b"
    },
    {
      "id": "rida_0027",
      "hadith_no": 27,
      "source": "Sahifat al-Imam Ali al-Rida",
